{"version":1,"content":"<p>出道25年的日本男團 KAT-TUN於去年3月底正式解散後，前主將龜梨和也亦告別事務所自立門戶。</p><p>今日(11日)，他宣布與離隊16年的前隊友赤西仁「世紀合體」，於明年8月18及19日在橫濱K-Arena合體開騷，亦是兩人相隔近18年再同台演出</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T13:19:12.364692+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T13:03:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T13:12:02.993536+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T13:12:02.993536+00:00","content_hash":"5480caca67a02c85fa01662a016fc756de30e42216b13ba69decaae3926138ff","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}